<title>FRANCE: France reports free-mkt wheat, barley, rye bids.</title>
<headline>France reports free-mkt wheat, barley, rye bids.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Grain exporters made the following bids for refunds to export free-market grain at this week's EU tender, an official at French cereals office ONIC said.</p>
<p>Bids for export refunds are in Ecus/tonne.</p>
<p>		     --- Nov 28 ---		 --- Nov 21---</p>
<p>		 Tonnage  Range of Bids     Tonnage  Range of Bids</p>
<p> Soft wheat  550,700   16.49-22.35	554,800   14.43-24.00</p>
<p> Barley	182,000   31.00-33.49	313,000   31.39-34.58</p>
<p> Rye	     5,000   31.49-31.95	  4,000   Not given</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
